config BR2_PACKAGE_WIFI_QR
	bool "Tab5 first-boot Wi-Fi QR helper"
	help
	  Shows the SoftAP ssid/psk from /tmp/credentials.txt as a QR
	  code: UTF-8 or ASCII text on stdout, or drawn onto /dev/fb0
	  on the Tab5 panel.  Installed only on Tab5 builds, where the
	  first boot shows it on the panel for fifteen minutes.
